{
  "_schema_version": 1,
  "kind": "section",
  "slug": "drawer-header",
  "label": "Drawer header",
  "description": "The header of the Studio quick-edit drawer: item type and Shared tags beside the item name, two icon buttons (open in full page, close), the technical name, a catalog / data product / connection line, the lifecycle stage, and a three-metric strip (Last updated, the linked items, Completion).",
  "role": "drawer-header",
  "apps": [
    "studio"
  ],
  "patterns": [
    "right-sliding-drawer"
  ],
  "tags": [
    "drawer",
    "header",
    "metrics"
  ],
  "derivedFrom": {
    "surface": "Studio > Catalog > result row body > quick edit drawer",
    "capturedOn": "2026-09-30",
    "productVersion": "manufacturing.zeenea.app/studio"
  },
  "slots": {
    "title": "Item type tag, Shared tag and the item name on one row; two icon buttons on the right: open in full page (view-detail) and close.",
    "catalog": "'Technical name: …', then 'Catalog: … / Data Product: … / Connection: …', then 'Stage:' with the lifecycle stage tag.",
    "metrics": "Three label-over-value pairs: Last updated with a date, the linked items (Fields on a Dataset) with a count as a link, and Completion with a progress bar and its percent."
  },
  "renderNotes": [
    "Parameters, filled by the page that splices it: item_type (an item-type-tag Type), item_name, technical_name, catalog_name, data_product, connection, stage and stage_type (read-only-tag Stage-1..8), last_updated, linked_label and linked_value (\"Fields\", \"2 Fields\" on a Dataset), completion_percent (a number).",
    "The two header actions are `button` Emphasis=Icon-only with `Icon` view-detail and close, the glyphs the DS drawer's own header draws.",
    "The item name is plain text on the captured drawer; it becomes an input only when clicked, so it is not drawn as one.",
    "The Shared tag is read-only-tag Type=Shared, the design system's light Shared; the product paints it solid dark."
  ],
  "skeleton": {
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "FRAME",
        "name": "Drawer header",
        "layout": {
          "mode": "VERTICAL",
          "spacing": 12,
          "padding": [
            16,
            16,
            12,
            16
          ]
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "FRAME",
            "name": "Title row",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
              "spacing": 8,
              "counterAxisAlignItems": "CENTER"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FRAME",
                "name": "Title block",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
                  "spacing": 8,
                  "counterAxisAlignItems": "CENTER"
                },
                "sizing": {
                  "horizontal": "FILL"
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "item-type-tag",
                    "variant": "Type={{item_type}}",
                    "props": {
                      "Label": "{{item_type}}"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "read-only-tag",
                    "variant": "Type=Shared",
                    "props": {
                      "Label": "Shared",
                      "Leading icon show": false
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "content": "{{item_name}}",
                    "font": "Inter:Semi Bold",
                    "size": 18,
                    "color": "var(--zen-color-text-default)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "FRAME",
                "name": "Header actions",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
                  "spacing": 4
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "button",
                    "variant": "Emphasis=Icon-only, Size=Small, State=Default",
                    "props": {
                      "Label": "Open in full page",
                      "Icon": "view-detail"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "button",
                    "variant": "Emphasis=Icon-only, Size=Small, State=Default",
                    "props": {
                      "Label": "Close",
                      "Icon": "close"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "content": "Technical name: {{technical_name}}",
            "font": "Inter:Regular",
            "size": 14,
            "color": "var(--zen-color-text-default)"
          },
          {
            "type": "TEXT",
            "content": "Catalog: {{catalog_name}} / Data Product: {{data_product}} / Connection: {{connection}}",
            "font": "Inter:Regular",
            "size": 14,
            "color": "var(--zen-color-text-secondary)"
          },
          {
            "type": "FRAME",
            "name": "Stage",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
              "spacing": 6,
              "counterAxisAlignItems": "CENTER"
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "TEXT",
                "content": "Stage:",
                "font": "Inter:Regular",
                "size": 14,
                "color": "var(--zen-color-text-default)"
              },
              {
                "type": "INSTANCE",
                "library": "ds",
                "dsSlug": "read-only-tag",
                "variant": "Type={{stage_type}}",
                "props": {
                  "Label": "{{stage}}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "FRAME",
            "name": "Metric strip",
            "layout": {
              "mode": "HORIZONTAL",
              "spacing": 24
            },
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "FRAME",
                "name": "Metric: Last updated",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "VERTICAL",
                  "spacing": 4
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "content": "Last updated",
                    "font": "Inter:Regular",
                    "size": 13,
                    "color": "var(--zen-color-text-secondary)"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "content": "{{last_updated}}",
                    "font": "Inter:Regular",
                    "size": 14,
                    "color": "var(--zen-color-text-default)"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "FRAME",
                "name": "Metric: {{linked_label}}",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "VERTICAL",
                  "spacing": 4
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "content": "{{linked_label}}",
                    "font": "Inter:Regular",
                    "size": 13,
                    "color": "var(--zen-color-text-secondary)"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "link",
                    "variant": "State=Default",
                    "props": {
                      "Label": "{{linked_value}}"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "FRAME",
                "name": "Metric: Completion",
                "layout": {
                  "mode": "VERTICAL",
                  "spacing": 4
                },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "content": "Completion",
                    "font": "Inter:Regular",
                    "size": 13,
                    "color": "var(--zen-color-text-secondary)"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "INSTANCE",
                    "library": "ds",
                    "dsSlug": "progress-bar-small",
                    "variant": "Size=Default",
                    "props": {
                      "Percent": "{{completion_percent}}"
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
